### Core Data Models & FHIR R4 Engine
#### [NEW] `src/types/fhir.ts`
- Types for FHIR R4 resources: `FHIRPatient`, `FHIRCondition` (ICD-10, SNOMED, verificationStatus, onsetDate), `FHIRObservation` (LOINC, valueQuantity, unit, referenceRange, interpretation, effectiveDateTime), `FHIRMedicationRequest` (RxNorm, dosage, authoredOn), `FHIRProcedure`, `FHIRDocumentReference` (unstructured clinical encounter notes).

#### [NEW] `src/types/protocol.ts`
- Protocol definitions: Trial metadata (NCT ID, Phase, Indication, Sponsor, Target Enrollment), Criteria structure:
  - `CriterionType`: `INCLUSION` | `EXCLUSION`
  - `Category`: `DEMOGRAPHICS` | `CONDITION` | `LABORATORY` | `MEDICATION` | `PROCEDURE` | `CLINICAL_NOTE`
  - `RuleDefinition`: field, code, operator (`>=`, `<=`, `==`, `BETWEEN`, `EXISTS`, `NOT_EXISTS`, `WITHIN_DAYS`), threshold, unit, temporal constraint.
  - `EvaluationResult`: `PASS` | `FAIL` | `INCONCLUSIVE` | `MANUAL_REVIEW`
  - `CriterionEvidence`: resourceType, resourceId, displayValue, date, noteExcerpt, confidenceScore, reasoning.

#### [NEW] `src/types/recruitment.ts`
- Patient recruitment pipeline status (`IDENTIFIED`, `ELIGIBLE`, `PHYSICIAN_CLEARED`, `OUTREACH_PENDING`, `SCREENING_CALL_SCHEDULED`, `CONSENTED`, `ENROLLED`, `DISQUALIFIED`), outreach logs, voice call screening transcripts, audit trail logs.

#### [NEW] `src/types/ehr.ts`
- EHR connector states for Epic (FHIR R4 US Core), athenahealth (MDR / Bulk Export), eClinicalWorks, OncoEMR (Flatiron). Sync metrics, pagination offsets, rate limits, retry workers.

